('friends', 2, 'What did this summer give you that you needed more than you realized?', '¿Qué te dio este verano que necesitabas más de lo que creías?'),
('friends', 2, 'What have you been going through that you kept out of the group chat?', '¿Qué has estado pasando que dejaste fuera del chat del grupo?'),
('friends', 2, 'Who in this group made your summer better, and do they know it?', '¿Quién de este grupo mejoró tu verano, y lo sabe?'),
('friends', 2, 'What is a way you have changed since June that you are happy about?', '¿En qué cambiaste desde junio que te gusta?'),
('friends', 2, 'What are you dreading about everything going back to normal?', '¿Qué te da pereza de que todo vuelva a la normalidad?'),
('friends', 2, 'What is something you wish we did more of this summer?', '¿Qué te hubiera gustado que hiciéramos más este verano?'),
('friends', 2, 'What is a moment from these months you know you will keep?', '¿Qué momento de estos meses sabes que vas a guardar?'),
('friends', 2, 'What do you need from us once everyone scatters again?', '¿Qué necesitas de nosotros cuando todos se dispersen otra vez?'),
('friends', 2, 'What is something you have been quietly proud of this summer?', '¿De qué has estado orgulloso en silencio este verano?'),
('friends', 2, 'When did you feel most like yourself these past few months?', '¿Cuándo te sentiste más tú mismo estos últimos meses?'),
('friends', 2, 'What is something about this friend group you do not want to lose?', '¿Qué de este grupo de amigos no quieres perder?'),
