('friends', 3, 'What is something you have never told this group?', '¿Qué nunca le has contado a este grupo?'),
('friends', 3, 'What is a fear you have about being truly known by us?', '¿Qué miedo tienes de que te conozcamos de verdad?'),
('friends', 3, 'What is something in this group you are jealous of?', '¿Qué de este grupo te da envidia?'),
('friends', 3, 'What did you need to hear this summer that nobody said?', '¿Qué necesitabas escuchar este verano que nadie dijo?'),
('friends', 3, 'What is something from your past that got louder for you this summer?', '¿Qué de tu pasado se hizo más fuerte para ti este verano?'),
('friends', 3, 'What are you afraid we would think differently of you for?', '¿Por qué temes que te veamos distinto?'),
-- Layer 4: raw, confessional
('friends', 4, 'What is something you did this summer that you have never confessed to anyone here?', '¿Qué hiciste este verano que nunca le has confesado a nadie aquí?'),
('friends', 4, 'Who in this group have you been quietly resentful of all summer?', '¿Con quién de este grupo has guardado resentimiento en silencio todo el verano?'),
('friends', 4, 'What is a truth about this friendship you have been avoiding saying all summer?', '¿Qué verdad sobre esta amistad has evitado decir todo el verano?'),
('friends', 4, 'What do you owe someone here an apology for before everyone scatters?', '¿Por qué le debes una disculpa a alguien de aquí antes de que todos se dispersen?'),
('friends', 4, 'What is the ugliest thought you have had this summer about someone you love?', '¿Cuál es el pensamiento más feo que tuviste este verano sobre alguien que quieres?'),
('friends', 4, 'What is a lie you told this group this summer?', '¿Qué mentira le dijiste a este grupo este verano?'),
('friends', 4, 'What are you ashamed of from these past few months?', '¿De qué te avergüenzas de estos últimos meses?'),
('friends', 4, 'Who did you let down this summer and never made it right with?', '¿A quién le fallaste este verano sin arreglarlo nunca?'),
