('friends', 4, 'What is a way you have not been a good friend lately?', '¿En qué no has sido un buen amigo últimamente?'),
('friends', 4, 'What is a regret from this summer that still gets to you?', '¿Qué arrepentimiento de este verano todavía te afecta?'),
('friends', 4, 'What are you still angry about that you claim to be over?', '¿Sobre qué sigues enojado aunque dices que ya lo superaste?'),
