('friends', 5, 'What is worth protecting about this group no matter what changes?', '¿Qué vale la pena proteger de este grupo sin importar lo que cambie?'),
('friends', 5, 'What is a promise you would make to this group before everyone scatters?', '¿Qué promesa le harías a este grupo antes de que todos se dispersen?'),
('friends', 5, 'What do you think brought us together, if you really think about it?', '¿Qué crees que nos unió, si lo piensas de verdad?'),
('friends', 5, 'What do you want said about you by the people who know you best?', '¿Qué quieres que digan de ti las personas que mejor te conocen?'),
('friends', 5, 'What is something you have made peace with that used to break you?', '¿Con qué hiciste las paces que antes te destrozaba?'),
('friends', 5, 'What is something you have survived that made you better at being a friend?', '¿Qué has sobrevivido que te hizo mejor amigo?'),
('friends', 5, 'What is the hardest lesson this year taught you that you are glad you learned?', '¿Cuál fue la lección más dura de este año que te alegra haber aprendido?'),
('friends', 5, 'What would you tell one of us if this were the last summer we all had together?', '¿Qué le dirías a uno de nosotros si este fuera el último verano que pasamos juntos?'),
